            "editor": "<p><strong>On this page</strong></p><ol data-sva-toc><li><a href=\"#s1\">Who we are</a></li><li><a href=\"#s2\">What this site collects</a></li><li><a href=\"#s3\">The forms</a></li><li><a href=\"#s4\">What we do with it</a></li><li><a href=\"#s5\">Your rights</a></li><li><a href=\"#s6\">When this site changes</a></li></ol><p class=\"sva-stamp\">Last written on 31 August 2026. Two things on this page are still to be confirmed by the owners and are marked where they sit.</p>",
