          {
           "id": "3500b893",
           "settings": {
            "editor": "<p>The forms on this site do not send anything anywhere by themselves. When you press send, your own mail programme opens with the answers written into a message addressed to us, and nothing leaves your computer until you send that message yourself.</p>\n<p>So we receive what you choose to send: your name, how to reach you, and what you tell us about your mare or the horse you are asking about.</p>",
