          {
           "id": "d8c85a1c",
           "settings": {
            "editor": "<p>Under the General Data Protection Regulation you can ask us what we hold about you, ask for it to be corrected, or ask for it to be deleted. Write to studvonaxe@gmail.com and we will answer.</p>\n<p>If you think we have handled your details badly you can complain to the Italian supervisory authority, the Garante per la protezione dei dati personali.</p>",
